Z||000000||Fierodave2001||05-21-2001||04:22 PM||||Hello all, It was nice to put faces to names and meet new friends.<P>According to my GPS, I avg 56 mph on the way up, on the way back it avg 60 mph  for over 1130 miles !<P>That's wild, 'cause I hit a bad rain storm through S.C. & Georgia<P>Hope we get show photo's posted soon.  Anyone seen any yet ?||||reg||6
Z||000001||skitime||05-21-2001||04:29 PM||||Glad to hear you made it back.  Thanks for bringing that beautiful car up for us to see. I hope the car got home safely too. It was very nice talking with you on Saturday.<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL><BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pictures-1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fierodave2001||05-21-2001||04:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>Glad to hear you made it back.  Thanks for bringing that beautiful car up for us to see. I hope the car got home safely too. It was very nice talking with you on Saturday.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Glad to hear you made it back.  Thanks for bringing that beautiful car up for us to see. I hope the car got home safely too. It was very nice talking with you on Saturday.<P>Aw Yes, there's those lights & frontend that I loved.  Very sharp ! <P>Just wish I could have seen the early, "Hey what if I do this"  project.<P>That must have been neat. <P>Yes, my car got home safely, - The Cherokee took the "hits" for it.<P>Ran into a big swarm of lovebugs on the way back.  The screen & windsheld were just pasted with them.  The Fiero didn't get a one !<P>The drive back seemed twice as long.<P>Was nice meeting you also, and if I did say before, I really like that front end!<BR>(yes Lisa was fine also)<P>||||reg||1
