Z||000010||Fierodave2001||05-21-2001||08:57 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by beachbomb:<BR><B>Hey Fierodave, were you going down I-95 this morning in jacksonville around 6am,<BR>if so i think i saw you, were you towing a blue gt fiero with a truck????Lmk, i was going nothbound in my Indy...later..Jim<BR>(p.s. want to trade my indy for the blue gt??????)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Yep, that was me !!  Boy did I hit some bad traffic there.<P>Did it stand out ?  or were you just looking at the right time ?<P>Lets see, trade ?  Why sure, I'll leave the key in the car at exit 32.  Gee, or was<BR>that exit 36 ? Haa<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Fierodave2001 (edited 05-21-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000011||Fierodave2001||05-21-2001||09:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>Hey Dave just really glad to have met you at Carlisle I know that drive well since I have done it al least 10 times, 17 hrs nonstop on most trips. Perhaps a trip to Datona with my Indy next year is in order. We'll see</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ditto on meeting you,  Gee, Daytona, I don't know, thats kind on far for me.  ha ha<P>The last one in March was really nice, that was the first time for me<P>Boy, what a class operation they set up, complete with buffet dinner before the awards program.<P>Did you hear about my car before ?  Some of the guys in Daytona knew of my car. One guy was so excited he couldn't wait to see it. <P>It was kind of neat to be surprised like that. I thought he was joking when he said, "Oh, we've heard about your car, we've been waiting to see it."<P>I had no idea the car was starting to get a reputation ! Did you hear how it did ?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000012||84Bill||05-21-2001||09:32 PM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierodave2001:<BR><B> Ditto on meeting you,  Gee, Daytona, I don't know, thats kind on far for me.  ha ha<P>The last one in March was really nice, that was the first time for me<P>Boy, what a class operation they set up, complete with buffet dinner before the awards program.<P>Did you hear about my car before ?  Some of the guys in Daytona knew of my car. One guy was so excited he couldn't wait to see it. <P>It was kind of neat to be surprised like that. I thought he was joking when he said, "Oh, we've heard about your car, we've been waiting to see it."<P>I had no idea the car was starting to get a reputation ! Did you hear how it did ?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LOL yeah it's gotta be the car Dave I saw the Pics of it on another site where you swept the copmetition I thought it was Datona. Oh and I found the guys family hiding out in Alaska, you know the one that slighted your car    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-21-2001).]||||reg||10
